'''Kalhuiki Tribe Members''' are mobs that spawn in the [[Jungle Temple]] and [[Jungle]], and will deal {{Stat|dmg|800,000}}. They have {{hp|1B}}, and drop nothing when killed.

== Spawning ==
'''Kalhuiki Tribe Members''' spawn in the {{Zone|Jungle}} and {{Zone|Jungle Temple}}.

== Behavior ==
'''Kalhuiki Tribe Members''' are passive until the player hits one of them 3 times, or hits a [[Kalhuiki Youngling]], after which they will attempt to attack the player, dealing {{Stat|dmg|800,000}} on contact.

They will not attack the player if the player is wearing a [[Kalhuiki Mask]].

