== Trivia ==
* The Kalhuiki Tribe Member has the highest {{Stat|Health}} of all [[Mobs]] in the game, excluding certain [[Catacombs Mobs]].
* The Kalhuiki Tribe Member cannot drop a soul when killed with a necromancy weapon

